tengine/godot/issues/121640#issuecomment-5049626362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121640","id":5049626362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLPsu-g","user":{"login":"warsang","id":9167018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNjcwMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9167018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang","html_url":"https://github.com/warsang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warsang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T17:59:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T18:00:17Z","body":"Just confirmed this works on 4.7\n\nSmaller mrp for 4.7 ( but roughly the same gdscript to craft the bad packet and pass the check):\n\nhttps://github.com/warsang/GodotOOBDemo/tree/master/mrp-4.7\n\nThis 4.7 demo can be run on windows with:\n\n Server: $env:GODOT_MODE='server'; godot --path mrp-4.7 --headless\n Client: $env:GODOT_MODE='client'; godot --path mrp-4.7 --headless\n\n(or you can change the script to grab --client / --server from the command line ).\n\nYou will want the build running the server to have ASAN in order to get the crash. The trace on my machine is available here: https://github.com/warsang/GodotOOBDemo/blob/master/.omo/evidence/mrp-4.7-server-err.txt but didn't have symbols enabled for the callstack.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5049626362/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]